process.stdout.write(`\n## Isolated Course Catalogue columns PostgreSQL integration track\n\nGenerated by \`node tests/fixtures/course-catalogue-columns/register.mjs\` from the separate Playwright integration report (workflow course-catalogue-columns-test.yml). These tests require the local SQL fixture (tests/fixtures/course-catalogue-columns/run.sh) and are outside the default UAT totals above.\n\n| Spec | Guards | Tests | Viewports | Acts on production | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ${spec} | ${guard} | ${tests} | desktop + phone | no | passing |\n`)
